1
00:00:00,900 --> 00:00:03,490
Something is writing
to me, in neon.

2
00:00:04,090 --> 00:00:06,870
I fix signs. At night. Alone.

3
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,150
This one came with no name, no
note, and four dead letters.

4
00:00:11,650 --> 00:00:13,910
I woke the first one. H.

5
00:00:14,510 --> 00:00:16,290
Then E. Then L.

6
00:00:17,190 --> 00:00:19,560
I figured it was
going to say hello.

7
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:21,130
It was not.

8
00:00:22,720 --> 00:00:24,560
So I reached for the plug.

9
00:00:24,660 --> 00:00:26,410
It was never plugged in.

10
00:00:27,310 --> 00:00:28,690
Then I turned it over.

11
00:00:28,690 --> 00:00:30,010
One word on the back.

12
00:00:30,010 --> 00:00:30,970
Tomorrow.

13
00:00:32,480 --> 00:00:35,550
And above me, a sign I
never made switched on.

14
00:00:35,840 --> 00:00:37,370
It had my name.
